<!-- The app copy is English-only for now: the Material date and time pickers keep their English wording on a Polish
     phone (buttons, hour / minute fields, tooltips). Same names as Material's values-pl, English text from its defaults.
     Scope (D-137, review SS-35 C1): only these 63 picker strings are overridden. About 38 other Material strings
     (bottom sheet drag handle, character counter, password toggle, checkbox state, slider, badge ...) still come from
     Material's own values-pl and are read in Polish on a Polish phone.
     TEMPORARY: more languages are planned. When the app gets real translations, move the picker strings into the
     per-language resources and delete this file (or the entries the translations make unnecessary), and re-check the
     Material strings above. Then also remove the MissingTranslation / ExtraTranslation lint exemption in
     ui-core/build.gradle.kts. -->
